{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309090","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1130909001:1":{"text":"저희는 괜찮아요. 초코보에게 몇 번 차인 것 말고는 별거 없어요.","source_cn":"我们啊，还好。被陆行鸟踢了几脚，没受大伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A67DFF3D8FE003","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130909002:1":{"text":"분명 이유가 있을 겁니다. 역병이든 지병이든, 어쩌면 미지의 재난 같은 거 말이에요. 아직 돈 벌 기회는 있으려나…","source_cn":"这背后一定有什么原因。瘟疫？疾病？或者其他未知的灾难。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70856D5DAAB5A1C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130909003:1":{"text":"말은 그렇지만, 그래도 조심하는 게 좋아.","source_cn":"说是这么说，但我们还是小心点比较好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F367CB4A560F430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130909004:0":{"text":"그렇다고 내가 겁쟁이는 아니라고!","source_cn":"我可不是畏手畏脚的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D73FF139A9CFC9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:行商德博拉":{"text":"행상 데보라","source":"行商德博拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:行商乔瑟夫":{"text":"행상 조지프","source":"行商乔瑟夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}